# Publication workflow

Branch `cur`. Re-freeze before work — do not trust static ED counts in docs.

```bash
git fetch --all --prune
git switch cur
git pull --ff-only origin cur
git status --short
git rev-parse HEAD
python3 scripts/publication_inventory.py
```

Expected live inventory: `main figures: 8/8`, `extended data: 10/10`. Release/tag/publish/archive: approval-gated (ED10 receipt ≠ release authorization).

Artifact pattern: `scripts/publication/<name>.py` → `figures/publication/<name>.png` → `outputs/publication/<name>_manifest.json` (+ optional `_receipt.json`).

Manifests must preserve `physical_amplitude_claim_allowed: false` and `performance_claims_allowed: false`. Capability/evidence wording only.

Validation:

```bash
python3 -m compileall -q scripts/publication jaxfne tests
python3 scripts/publication/<name>.py
python3 scripts/publication_inventory.py
python3 -m mkdocs build --strict
PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1 PYTHONPATH=. python3 -m pytest tests/test_api_smoke.py tests/test_root_import_lightweight.py -q --tb=line
```
